#: ../../library/array.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`array` -- arrays of numeric data"
msgstr ":mod:`array` -- 数値データの配列"

#: ../../library/array.rst:7
msgid "|see_cpython_module| :mod:`python:array`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/array.rst:9
msgid ""
"Supported format codes: ``b``, ``B``, ``h``, ``H``, ``i``, ``I``, ``l``, "
"``L``, ``q``, ``Q``, ``f``, ``d`` (the latter 2 depending on the "
"floating-point support)."
msgstr ""
"サポートする書式コード: ``b``, ``B``, ``h``, ``H``, ``i``, ``I``, ``l``, "
"``L``, ``q``, ``Q``, ``f``, ``d`` (最後の２つは浮動小数点サポートに依存します)。"

#: ../../library/array.rst:14 ../../library/collections.rst:13
#: ../../library/cryptolib.rst:8 ../../library/deflate.rst:23
