"and rssi values::"
msgstr ""
"**ピアデバイステーブル** への参照: 既知のピアデバイスと RSSI 値の辞書です。"

#: ../../library/espnow.rst:616
msgid "{peer: [rssi, time_ms], ...}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/espnow.rst:618
msgid "where:"
msgstr "ここでの各項目は次のとおりです:"

#: ../../library/espnow.rst:620
msgid "``peer`` is the peer MAC address (as `bytes`);"
msgstr "``peer`` はピアの MAC アドレス(`bytes`)です。"

#: ../../library/espnow.rst:621
msgid ""
"``rssi`` is the wifi signal strength in dBm (-127 to 0) of the last "
"message received from the peer; and"
msgstr ""
"``rssi`` はピアからの最新の受信メッセージの wifi 信号強度です(dBm: -127 から 0 の範囲)。"

#: ../../library/espnow.rst:623
msgid ""
"``time_ms`` is the time the message was received (in milliseconds since "
"system boot - wraps every 12 days)."
msgstr ""
"``time_ms`` はメッセージの受信時刻です(システム起動からのミリ秒単位の経過時間、"
"12日ごとにラップ)。"

#: ../../library/espnow.rst:628
